-<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/ALBT> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Obsolete name. Coal. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Duckmantian Substage (Carboniferous Period) (318-314.75 Ma BP)."@en .
